// A creature with two variants (a vixen and a tod, picked for each meeting with
// the player's filter settings), a loot drop, and a form: losing to the fox
// slowly changes the player's body, one part at a time.

== creature forest_fox
name: Forest Fox
found in: forest
active: always
level: 1
hp: 14
damage: 3
stats: strength 8, dexterity 14, stamina 10, perception 14, intelligence 10, charisma 12
libido: 20
form: forest_fox
gender: female
// The item and the chance it drops after a win.
loot: wild_berries 40%
tags: woodland
// Variants: each meeting picks one the player's filters allow. Scenes test
// "forest_fox is variant male" or "forest_fox is female"; the pronouns [ghe],
// [ghis] and [gche] (capitalized) follow the variant met now.
variants:
    female:
        gender: female
    male:
        gender: male
        hp: 16
// The encounter plays before every fight with the fox; it can change values.
encounter:
    ~ woods.fox_meetings + 1 quietly
    A russet [if forest_fox is variant male]tod[else]vixen[end if] steps onto the path, tail swishing. [gche] grins at you with far too many teeth.[if woods.fox_meetings > 1] [gche] looks familiar.[end if]
// Attack lines are picked each round; they may include small effects.
attack:
    [one of]The fox nips at your ankle![or]The fox darts in and scratches you![or]The fox kicks dirt in your face![at random]
defeated:
    The fox yips and bounds off into the undergrowth.
victory:
    The fox circles you once, licks your cheek and trots away. Something itches at the base of your spine.

// The form: what each body part becomes. Losing a fight infects with one part.
== form forest_fox
name: Forest Fox
scale: 3
body type: [one of]vulpine[or]fox-like[at random]
descriptor: lithe, quick
head:
    description: that of a fox, with tall pointed ears
    change: your face stretches into a narrow muzzle and your ears rise into points
skin:
    description: russet fur
    change: soft russet fur spreads across your skin
tail:
    description: A bushy red fox tail sways behind you.
    change: the itch at the base of your spine grows into a bushy red tail

// A second creature: found at the river, and not infectious.
== creature river_otter
name: River Otter
found in: riverbank
level: 1
hp: 10
damage: 2
gender: male
infectious: no
tags: woodland
encounter:
    A sleek otter pops out of the water, chattering at you like you owe him money.
attack:
    [one of]The otter slaps you with a wet tail![or]The otter splashes river water in your eyes![at random]
defeated:
    The otter slides back into the river in a huff.
victory:
    The otter steals a berry from your pocket and swims off, very pleased with himself.
